          {
            "title": "Question 1",
            "id": 59764,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que este código exibe no console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" income = \" /><text value=\"1400\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" savings = \" /><text value=\"900\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"savings = \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"income = \" /><text value=\"1500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(savings);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1000\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>1000</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1500</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>900</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>1000</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Por que o último <code>console.log(savings)</code> exibe esse valor?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" income = \" /><text value=\"1400\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" savings = \" /><text value=\"900\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"savings = \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"income = \" /><text value=\"1500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(savings);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1000\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ele exibe <code>1000</code> porque esse valor substituiu <code>900</code> em <code>savings</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ele exibe <code>1500</code> porque esse é o último valor atribuído em qualquer lugar</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Ele exibe <code>900</code> porque uma variável mantém seu primeiro valor</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ele exibe <code>1000</code> porque esse valor substituiu <code>900</code> em <code>savings</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 5",
            "id": 59768,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Exiba <code>goal</code> menos <code>milesRan</code> no console.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" goal = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" milesRan = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Miles left: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(goal - milesRan);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Miles left: \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>goal</code> seguido de <code>-</code> e finalmente <code>milesRan</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Depois do rótulo, exiba quantas milhas faltam para atingir <code>goal</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" goal = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" milesRan = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Miles left: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(goal - milesRan);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"+\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"*\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Miles left: \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>goal</code> seguido de <code>-</code> e finalmente <code>milesRan</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
