          {
            "title": "Question 4",
            "id": 59767,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual é o valor de <code>number3</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number1 = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number2 = \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number3 = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"number3 = number1 + number2;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>7</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>10</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>4</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>7</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Depois que a última linha é executada, qual valor <code>number3</code> armazena e por quê?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number1 = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number2 = \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number3 = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"number3 = number1 + number2;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>7</code>, porque <code>3 + 4</code> substitui o valor anterior</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>10</code>, porque uma reatribuição não pode substituir um valor existente</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>4</code>, porque apenas o segundo operando é armazenado</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>7</code>, porque <code>3 + 4</code> substitui o valor anterior.</p></body></html>"
          },
